{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>大嶼山發生車禍。周一（18日）清晨6時25分，一輛的士沿文東路往東涌巿中心方向行駛，至映灣園對開撞倒一名60至70歲男子。據報傷者一度被困，昏迷不</p><p>現場消息稱，事主在行人過路處步出，由車頭右邊過左邊，其間被的士撞倒，現場遺下一隻手錶和一頂帽子。的士司機涉嫌危險駕駛導致他人死亡被捕，警方正調查車禍成因。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1132961563196788736721469.jpeg/jbQp0t8CCrcqJRR7AAf2hpIk9gYrlSXIDVm8pg1ZvKY\" alt=\"現場是行人過路處。（蔡正邦攝）\"><figcaption>現場是行人過路處。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1132961559912517632340876.jpeg/qzvnNOCPPvUWVyKhdV92w0CjDU1ay7F_tqDIpLagyKQ\" alt=\"的士車頭凹陷。（蔡正邦攝）\"><figcaption>的士車頭凹陷。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1132961556628246528760324.jpeg/_odzLqlLhgbEFvkpsytq2IlbH2Ui_NKS-xp_X_saf18\" alt=\"的士撞倒男途人，傷者送院搶救不治。（蔡正邦攝）\"><figcaption>的士撞倒男途人，傷者送院搶救不治。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1132960966192009216648175.jpeg/q5ykoCdGQDGkpzUvmsYCURbTnmMrUovNsEwLSrBMC0o\" alt=\"現場遺下一頂鴨舌帽。（蔡正邦攝）\"><figcaption>現場遺下一頂鴨舌帽。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1132960962979041280982360.jpeg/41dMmSC_Bk2FGTWMXwo6e3gEact2x_bCP1Fhxj9RYcY\" alt=\"現場遺下一隻手錶。（蔡正邦攝）\"><figcaption>現場遺下一隻手錶。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1132963597924700160594713.jpeg/y7z6nBVxwYXjVc-RuzL-umLnSE7dx8w_PW9rFT1vaxU\" alt=\"現場遺下鴨舌帽。（蔡正邦攝）\"><figcaption>現場遺下鴨舌帽。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1132963600399470592056984.jpeg/ZjNw3qHw88mgZPVXnv-s22MtSe5hPRBAoaV62aGletk\" alt=\"警員在場調查車禍。（蔡正邦攝）\"><figcaption>警員在場調查車禍。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1132963602513530880726143.jpeg/IoGRxID45Qh2GLDRC5H4jf7Em1M7PHommG4sHJhuLBw\" alt=\"現場是行人過路處。（蔡正邦攝）\"><figcaption>現場是行人過路處。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-18T01: